   'With over 160 million records sold worldwide, Joel is one of the world''s best-selling music artists[3] and is the fourth-best-selling solo artist in the United States.[4] His 1985 compilation album, G', 'With over 160 million records sold worldwide, Joel is one of the world''s best-selling music artists[3] and is the fourth-best-selling solo artist in the United States.[4] His 1985 compilation album, Greatest Hits – Volume I & Volume II, is one of the best-selling albums in the U.S.[5]  Joel was born in the Bronx in New York City and grew up in the Levittown portion of Hicksville on Long Island, where he began taking piano lessons at his mother''s insistence.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
