  ('ev_wiki_cole-porter_1935_21', 'ent_cole-porter', '1935-12', 1935, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'The Porters moved to Hollywood in December 1935, but Porter''s wife did not like the movie environment, and Porter''s closeted homosexual acts, formerly very discreet, became less so; she retreated to t', 'The Porters moved to Hollywood in December 1935, but Porter''s wife did not like the movie environment, and Porter''s closeted homosexual acts, formerly very discreet, became less so; she retreated to their Paris house.[74][75] When his film assignment on Rosalie was finished in 1937, Porter hastened to Paris to make peace with Linda, but she remained cool.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
