  ('ev_wiki_crazy-horse_1877_5', 'ent_crazy-horse', '1877-09', 1877, 'narrative_death', 'narrative',
   'In September 1877, after being brought to Camp Robinson in northwestern Nebraska, he was fatally wounded by a bayonet in the course of an alleged struggle with a guard while being confined to the post', 'In September 1877, after being brought to Camp Robinson in northwestern Nebraska, he was fatally wounded by a bayonet in the course of an alleged struggle with a guard while being confined to the post guardhouse.[4] His death quickly became the subject of conflicting accounts, but he has since endured as a symbol of Lakota resistance and cultural integrity.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
   'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crazy_Horse', 0.7, 5, 'en', 'MONTH', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
