  ('ev_wiki_creflo-dollar_2022_1', 'ent_creflo-dollar', NULL, 2022, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'However, in the 2010s, his ministry shifted focus toward what he terms the "Gospel of Grace." In 2022, Dollar garnered significant public attention for formally retracting his long-held teachings on m', 'However, in the 2010s, his ministry shifted focus toward what he terms the "Gospel of Grace." In 2022, Dollar garnered significant public attention for formally retracting his long-held teachings on mandatory tithing, stating that the practice is not required for New Testament believers.[4]  Dollar''s ministry has a global reach through his television program, Changing Your World.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
