   'He has frequently been the subject of public scrutiny and criticism regarding his personal wealth and the financial transparency of his ministry.[5]  Ministry career  Dollar began his ministry in 1986', 'He has frequently been the subject of public scrutiny and criticism regarding his personal wealth and the financial transparency of his ministry.[5]  Ministry career  Dollar began his ministry in 1986, holding the first worship service of World Changers Ministries Christian Center in the cafeteria of Kathleen Mitchell Elementary School in College Park, Georgia, with eight people in attendance.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
