   'He suffered minor injuries from the event, visiting the MedStar Washington Hospital Center for treatment.[66] News of the attack led to public scrutiny of the Supreme Court Police''s security detail, w', 'He suffered minor injuries from the event, visiting the MedStar Washington Hospital Center for treatment.[66] News of the attack led to public scrutiny of the Supreme Court Police''s security detail, which was not present at the time.[67]  According to Jeffrey Toobin''s 2007 book The Nine, Souter had a decidedly low-tech lifestyle: He wrote with a fountain pen, did not use email, and had no cellphone or answering machine.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
