  ('ev_wiki_fannie-lou-hamer_1961_8', 'ent_fannie-lou-hamer', NULL, 1961, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'So she''s only in fourth grade now.  — Fannie Lou Hamer[9]  Hamer and her husband wanted very much to start a family, but in 1961, a doctor subjected Hamer to a hysterectomy without her consent while s', 'So she''s only in fourth grade now.  — Fannie Lou Hamer[9]  Hamer and her husband wanted very much to start a family, but in 1961, a doctor subjected Hamer to a hysterectomy without her consent while she was undergoing surgery to remove a uterine tumor.[15] Forced sterilization was a common method of population control in Mississippi that targeted poor, African-American women.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
