   'EducationSchool of the Art Institute of Chicago Known forPainting, architect Notable workAmerican Gothic MovementRegionalism RelativesNan Wood Graham (sister) Signature  Grant DeVolson Wood (February ', 'EducationSchool of the Art Institute of Chicago Known forPainting, architect Notable workAmerican Gothic MovementRegionalism RelativesNan Wood Graham (sister) Signature  Grant DeVolson Wood (February 13, 1891 – February 12, 1942) was an American artist and representative of Regionalism, best known for his paintings depicting the rural American Midwest.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
