  ('ev_wiki_grant-wood_1919_4', 'ent_grant-wood', NULL, 1919, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'Career  Near the end of World War I, Wood joined the army, working as an artist designing camouflage scenes as well as other art.[7]  From 1919 to 1925, Wood taught art to junior high school students ', 'Career  Near the end of World War I, Wood joined the army, working as an artist designing camouflage scenes as well as other art.[7]  From 1919 to 1925, Wood taught art to junior high school students in the Cedar Rapids public school system.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
