  ('ev_wiki_henry-david-thoreau_1814_4', 'ent_henry-david-thoreau', NULL, 1814, 'narrative_death', 'narrative',
   'John Jr. (1814–1842) died at age 27,[25] of tetanus after cutting himself while shaving.[26] Henry David (1817–1862) died at age 44, of tuberculosis.[27] Sophia (1819–1876) survived him by 14 years, d', 'John Jr. (1814–1842) died at age 27,[25] of tetanus after cutting himself while shaving.[26] Henry David (1817–1862) died at age 44, of tuberculosis.[27] Sophia (1819–1876) survived him by 14 years, dying at age 56,[24] of tuberculosis.[28]  He studied at Harvard College between 1833 and 1837.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
