   'He endured the pain for several days with the help of opium before he died surrounded by family on Friday, March 24.[91] He had been suffering from peritonitis.[92] At the time of his death, his estat', 'He endured the pain for several days with the help of opium before he died surrounded by family on Friday, March 24.[91] He had been suffering from peritonitis.[92] At the time of his death, his estate was worth an estimated $356,320 (~$12.3 million in 2024 terms).[84] He is buried with both of his wives at Mount Auburn Cemetery in Cambridge, Massachusetts.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
