   'Instead he pulled Melville out of the bank to man the cap and fur store.[39]  Intermittent work and studies  In 1835, while still working in the store, Melville enrolled in Albany Classical School, pe', 'Instead he pulled Melville out of the bank to man the cap and fur store.[39]  Intermittent work and studies  In 1835, while still working in the store, Melville enrolled in Albany Classical School, perhaps using Maria''s part of the proceeds from the sale of the estate of his maternal grandmother in March 1835.[41] In September of the following year, Herman was back at The Albany Academy, participating in the school''s Latin course.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
