   'Portrait of Madame X  Main article: Portrait of Madame X  John Singer Sargent in his studio with Portrait of Madame X, c. 1885  His most controversial work, Portrait of Madame X (Madame Pierre Gautrea', 'Portrait of Madame X  Main article: Portrait of Madame X  John Singer Sargent in his studio with Portrait of Madame X, c. 1885  His most controversial work, Portrait of Madame X (Madame Pierre Gautreau) (1884) is now considered one of his best works and was his favorite; he stated in 1915: "I suppose it is the best thing I have done."[36] When unveiled in Paris at the 1884 Salon, it aroused such a negative reaction that it likely prompted Sargent''s move to London.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
