   'Four days after they met, Bench proposed, and they were married on February 21, 1975.[111][112] Quickly, the pair realized they were incompatible, especially after Bench suggested that his wife accept', 'Four days after they met, Bench proposed, and they were married on February 21, 1975.[111][112] Quickly, the pair realized they were incompatible, especially after Bench suggested that his wife accept Hustler magazine''s offer for her to pose nude for $25,000.[113][114] They broke up at the end of the season (Bench reportedly said to her, "Now I''m done with two things I hate: baseball and you"), divorcing after just 13 months. "I tried.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
