   'Mitchell''s vocal range began to shift from mezzo-soprano to that of a wide-ranging contralto around 1975.[9][10][11] Her distinctive piano and open-tuned guitar compositions also grew more harmonicall', 'Mitchell''s vocal range began to shift from mezzo-soprano to that of a wide-ranging contralto around 1975.[9][10][11] Her distinctive piano and open-tuned guitar compositions also grew more harmonically and rhythmically complex as she melded jazz with rock and roll, R&B, classical music and non-Western beats.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
