   'She was awarded the Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2002.[13]  Mitchell produced or co-produced most of her albums and designed most of her own album covers, describing herself as a "painter dera', 'She was awarded the Grammy Lifetime Achievement Award in 2002.[13]  Mitchell produced or co-produced most of her albums and designed most of her own album covers, describing herself as a "painter derailed by circumstance".[14] A critic of the music industry, she quit touring and released her 19th and last album of original songs in 2007.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
