  ('ev_wiki_ken-thompson_2004_14', 'ent_ken-thompson', NULL, 2004, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'In 2004, he assisted in the implementation of Turochamp, a chess program Alan Turing devised in 1948, before any computers existed that could execute it.[33]  He worked at Entrisphere, Inc. as a fello', 'In 2004, he assisted in the implementation of Turochamp, a chess program Alan Turing devised in 1948, before any computers existed that could execute it.[33]  He worked at Entrisphere, Inc. as a fellow until 2006.   2020s  As of 2024[update] he works at Google, first as a Distinguished Engineer and later as a Google Advisor.[34] Recent work has included the co-design of the Go programming language.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
