  ('ev_wiki_amelia-earhart_1918_12', 'ent_amelia-earhart', '1918-12', 1918, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'She was discharged in December 1918, about two months later.[33] Her sinus-related symptoms were pain and pressure around one eye, and copious mucus drainage via the nostrils and throat.[35] While sta', 'She was discharged in December 1918, about two months later.[33] Her sinus-related symptoms were pain and pressure around one eye, and copious mucus drainage via the nostrils and throat.[35] While staying in the hospital during the pre-antibiotic era, Earhart had painful minor operations to wash out the affected maxillary sinus[33][34][35] but these procedures were not successful and her headaches worsened.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
