   'She asked her father to ask about passenger flights and flying lessons.[40] Earhart was booked for a passenger flight the following day at Emory Roger''s Field, at the corner[44] of Wilshire Boulevard ', 'She asked her father to ask about passenger flights and flying lessons.[40] Earhart was booked for a passenger flight the following day at Emory Roger''s Field, at the corner[44] of Wilshire Boulevard and Fairfax Avenue.[40] A 10-minute flight with Frank Hawks, who later gained fame as an air racer, cost $10 (equivalent to $160 in 2025).', 'src_en_wikipedia',
