  ('ev_wiki_sylvia-plath_1962_17', 'ent_sylvia-plath', NULL, 1962, 'narrative_death', 'narrative',
   'The winter of 1962–1963 was one of the coldest on record in the UK; the pipes froze, the children—now two years old and nine months—were often sick, and the house had no telephone.[40] Her depression ', 'The winter of 1962–1963 was one of the coldest on record in the UK; the pipes froze, the children—now two years old and nine months—were often sick, and the house had no telephone.[40] Her depression returned, but she kept on writing poetry, which would be published after her death.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
