  ('ev_wiki_warren-buffett_2026_7', 'ent_warren-buffett', NULL, 2026, 'narrative', 'narrative',
   'He has been referred to as the "Oracle" or "Sage" of Omaha by global media as a result of having accumulated a massive fortune derived from his business and investment success.[6][7] Buffett adheres t', 'He has been referred to as the "Oracle" or "Sage" of Omaha by global media as a result of having accumulated a massive fortune derived from his business and investment success.[6][7] Buffett adheres to the principles of value investing and frugality despite his wealth.[8] Buffett met Chuck Feeney and has pledged to give away 99 percent[9] of his fortune to philanthropic causes; until 2026 his giving was primarily to the Gates Foundation.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
