   'Early life  Annie Oakley was born Phoebe Ann "Annie" Mosey[2][3][4] on August 13, 1860, in a log cabin less than two miles (3.2 km) northwest of Woodland, now Willowdell, in Darke County, Ohio, a rura', 'Early life  Annie Oakley was born Phoebe Ann "Annie" Mosey[2][3][4] on August 13, 1860, in a log cabin less than two miles (3.2 km) northwest of Woodland, now Willowdell, in Darke County, Ohio, a rural county along the state line with Indiana.[5] Her birthplace is about five miles (8 km) east of North Star.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
