   'When Hap Emms, the general manager of the Bruins offered a US$5,000 (US$49,615 in 2025 dollars[27]) signing bonus and US$7,000 and US$8,000 (US$69,462 and US$77,246 in 2025 dollars[27]) for his first ', 'When Hap Emms, the general manager of the Bruins offered a US$5,000 (US$49,615 in 2025 dollars[27]) signing bonus and US$7,000 and US$8,000 (US$69,462 and US$77,246 in 2025 dollars[27]) for his first two years in the league, Eagleson countered with US$100,000 (US$992,308 in 2025 dollars[27]) for the two years.[28] Orr would refuse to play with the Bruins and played for Canada''s national team instead, like Carl Brewer.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
