   'Early life and education  Walter Bruce Willis was born on March 19, 1955, in Idar-Oberstein, West Germany;[5] his mother, Marlene,[6] was from Kassel, Germany,[7] and his father, David Willis (1929–20', 'Early life and education  Walter Bruce Willis was born on March 19, 1955, in Idar-Oberstein, West Germany;[5] his mother, Marlene,[6] was from Kassel, Germany,[7] and his father, David Willis (1929–2009), was an American soldier.[8] He has a younger sister, Florence, and two younger brothers, Robert (1959–2001) and David.[9] After being discharged from the military in 1957, his father relocated the family to his hometown of Carneys Point, New Jersey.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
