  ('ev_wiki_joseph-schooling_2016_12', 'ent_joseph-schooling', '2016-08-12', 2016, 'narrative_achievement', 'narrative',
   'His bronze medal was Singapore''s first ever medal at the FINA World Aquatics Championships.[21]  2016 Olympics  On 12 August 2016, in Rio de Janeiro, Schooling won a gold medal in the 100 m butterfly ', 'His bronze medal was Singapore''s first ever medal at the FINA World Aquatics Championships.[21]  2016 Olympics  On 12 August 2016, in Rio de Janeiro, Schooling won a gold medal in the 100 m butterfly with a time of 50.39 seconds, the first Olympic gold medal won by Singapore.[22] The time set a new Olympic record, beating Phelps'' record of 50.58 seconds at the 2008 Summer Olympics.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
   'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Schooling', 0.7, 12, 'en', 'DAY', unixepoch(), unixepoch());
