   'Since 2010, the Atlanta area has experienced notable immigration from India, China, South Korea, and Jamaica.[176][177] Other notable source countries of immigrants are Vietnam, Eritrea, Nigeria, the ', 'Since 2010, the Atlanta area has experienced notable immigration from India, China, South Korea, and Jamaica.[176][177] Other notable source countries of immigrants are Vietnam, Eritrea, Nigeria, the Arabian gulf, Ukraine and Poland.[178] Within a few decades, and in keeping with national trends, immigrants from England, Ireland, and German-speaking central Europe were no longer the majority of Atlanta''s foreign-born population.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
