  ('ev_wiki_central-park_2026_11', 'plc_central-park', '2026-03', 2026, 'narrative_founding', 'narrative',
   'Before the unit was established in 1975, municipal EMS often took over 30 minutes to respond to incidents in the park.[35]  History  John Randel Jr.''s surveying bolt  It has been suggested that this s', 'Before the unit was established in 1975, municipal EMS often took over 30 minutes to respond to incidents in the park.[35]  History  John Randel Jr.''s surveying bolt  It has been suggested that this section be split out into another article titled History of Central Park. (Discuss) (March 2026)  Planning  Between 1821 and 1855, New York City''s population nearly quadrupled.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
