  ('ev_wiki_central-park_1985_19', 'plc_central-park', '1985-10-09', 1985, 'narrative_birth', 'narrative',
   'The city dedicated Strawberry Fields in Lennon''s honor in April 1981,[451] and the memorial was completely rebuilt and rededicated on what would have been Lennon''s 45th birthday, October 9, 1985.[452]', 'The city dedicated Strawberry Fields in Lennon''s honor in April 1981,[451] and the memorial was completely rebuilt and rededicated on what would have been Lennon''s 45th birthday, October 9, 1985.[452] Countries from all around the world contributed trees, and Italy donated the "Imagine" mosaic in the center of the memorial.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
