   'Following Central Park''s restoration, some of the city''s most expensive properties have been sold or rented near the park.[531] The value of the land in Central Park was estimated to be about $528.8 b', 'Following Central Park''s restoration, some of the city''s most expensive properties have been sold or rented near the park.[531] The value of the land in Central Park was estimated to be about $528.8 billion in December 2005, though this was based on the park''s impact on the average value of nearby land.[571]  In the modern day, it is estimated that Central Park has resulted in billions of dollars in economic impact.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
