   'Duffy jumped and was not seen again.[361] Additionally, the cartoonist Otto Eppers jumped and survived in 1910, and was then tried and acquitted for attempted suicide.[362] The Brooklyn Bridge has sin', 'Duffy jumped and was not seen again.[361] Additionally, the cartoonist Otto Eppers jumped and survived in 1910, and was then tried and acquitted for attempted suicide.[362] The Brooklyn Bridge has since developed a reputation as a suicide bridge due to the number of jumpers who do so intending to kill themselves, though exact statistics are difficult to find.[363]  Other notable feats have taken place on or near the bridge.', 'src_en_wikipedia',
